OL,3,GNEWSATwo people due before court
OL,4,Afollowing arson attack deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people who were arrested in
OL,7,Fconnection with an arson attack which
OL,8,Fkilled four family members in Waterford
OL,9,Fhave been charged by gardai (Irish
OL,10,Fpolice).
OL,12,FKim English, Philip English and two of
OL,13,Ftheir children - nine-year-old Jayden
OL,14,Fand 12-year-old Callum - died after
OL,15,Ftheir home in Birch Avenue was set on
OL,16,Ffire on Tuesday.
OL,18,FTwo other children who were also in the
OL,19,Fhouse at the time were critically
OL,20,Finjured and were taken to hospital in
OL,21,FCrumlin in Dublin.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
