OL,3,GNEWSATwo people due before court
OL,4,Afollowing arson attack deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe suspects, a man aged in his 20s and
OL,7,Fa woman in her 30s, were arrested on
OL,8,FThursday and are due to appear before a
OL,9,Fspecial sitting of Clonmel District
OL,10,FCourt in County Tipperary on Saturday
OL,11,Fafternoon.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
